Hi Dave,

Thanks very much for letting us know about this. This is indeed a bug in our new handling of posterior predictive nodes. As I noted in the email I just sent out to the users list, you can revert to the previous behavior of how NIMBLE handled predictive nodes by setting:

nimbleOptions(MCMCusePredictiveDependenciesInCalculations = TRUE)

and then rebuild/reconfigure and rerun your MCMC.

We'll fix this shortly in a bug fix release, 0.13.1.

-Chris

