Subject: cylic graph error with different ways of writing model with autoregressive term
Message-ID: <UusDQuQLz3Q.p_glV8OuAwAJ@nimble-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/nimble-users/c/UusDQuQLz3Q/m/p_glV8OuAwAJ>
